@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title Confirmed ownership in the shop
participant "ShopUI / ShopSender" as UI
participant ClientHandler as H
participant UserManager as U
database "CSV files" as D
UI -> H : BUY_ICON|nickname,index
H -> U : Read ownership, price and wallet
alt Owned item or insufficient funds: return
 H -> H : return
else
 H -> U : Deduct wallet; set owned item
 H -> U : SaveUserProfile(id)
 U -> D : UserProfile.csv
 H -> U : SaveUserIcons(id)
 U -> D : UserIcon.csv
 H -> UI : COIN_INFO + STORE_ICON_LIST
 UI -> UI : Update wallet and current-tab ownership
end
note over U,D
The two CSV writes are sequential.
They are not an atomic transaction or a durable request ledger.
end note
@enduml
